          "message": "feat(rds): built-in database observability via sidecar exporters (#83)\n\n* feat(rds): add metrics fields to database domain and schema\n\n* feat(rds): support metrics columns in database repository\n\n* feat(rds): update database port interface for metrics\n\n* feat(rds): implement metrics sidecar injection in DatabaseService\n\n* feat(rds): support metrics_enabled flag in database API handlers\n\n* test(rds): support metrics columns in database repository tests\n\n* test(rds): update unit, integration, and benchmark tests for metrics sidecar logic\n\n* docs(rds): add ADR-019 and update guide for database observability\n\n* feat(rds): refine metrics sidecar logic and apply formatting",
