          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c4f13e71ed6b102c5c2dd9ec2793d3dc80d60f01",
          "message": "feat: make Pipeline, Queue, and Cache tenant-scoped\n\nFinding #10 identified that Pipeline, Queue, and Cache were user-owned\nrather than tenant-owned, unlike all other infrastructure resources.\nThis change makes them consistent with the existing tenant-scoped pattern.\n\nChanges:\n- Add TenantID to Pipeline and Build domain models\n- Add TenantID to Queue domain model (already present on Cache)\n- Update PipelineRepository to filter all queries by tenant_id\n- Update QueueRepository to filter all queries by tenant_id\n- Update CacheRepository to filter by tenant_id (was ignoring it)\n- Update PipelineService to extract tenantID from context and set on\n  pipelines and builds\n- Update QueueService to use tenantID for all repo calls\n- Update CacheService to use tenantID for repo calls\n- Add migration 105 for pipelines and builds tenant_id column\n\nCache and Queue tables already had tenant_id via migration 071,\nso only the pipelines migration is new.",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:58:53+03:00",
          "tree_id": "638d76ab4562d7d207f2bb41da338f1c2f43fc5c",
          "url": "https://github.com/poyrazK/thecloud/commit/c4f13e71ed6b102c5c2dd9ec2793d3dc80d60f01"
