          "id": "bea7dd3344275207c4db30bd01428891bafc121b",
          "message": "fix(#348): add shutdown mechanism to WebSocket Hub.Run() goroutine (#356)\n\n- Add stopCh and stoppedCh channels to Hub struct\n- Add Stop() and Stopped() methods to Hub\n- Modify Run() to listen on stopCh and exit cleanly via deferred close(stoppedCh)\n- Add Services.Shutdown() that calls WsHub.Stop()\n- Call svcs.Shutdown() during application shutdown\n- Add TestHubShutdown test to verify clean shutdown behavior",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-29T20:57:11+03:00",
