          "distinct": true,
          "id": "98cd65c989fe6c6ec49536908ffb0ebf1d88388f",
          "message": "fix: pass ctx to Coordinator to avoid context.Background() leak\n\nSyncClusterState now accepts ctx to allow proper cancellation and\nshutdown coordination. Previously it used context.Background() directly\nwhich leaked goroutines with no way to stop them.\n\nAlso fix goroutine leaks in cluster.go (RepairCluster and ScaleCluster)\nand lifecycle_worker.go (untracked goroutine).",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-02T16:45:43+03:00",
          "tree_id": "24a888cb91e3080b72e4e4eb0152c9e93d74a6d9",
          "url": "https://github.com/poyrazK/thecloud/commit/98cd65c989fe6c6ec49536908ffb0ebf1d88388f"
