          "distinct": true,
          "id": "25ce82d1bfba6641277805d873624a71ba659e85",
          "message": "fix(repos/postgres): return empty slice instead of nil when no databases found (#486)\n\n* fix(repos/postgres): return empty slice instead of nil when no databases found\n\nWhen scanDatabases returns nil (no rows), JSON marshal produces \"null\"\ninstead of \"[]\". Initialize the slice with make() so empty results marshal\nas empty array.\n\nFixes #459\n\n* test(repos/postgres): add empty result tests for List and ListReplicas\n\nAdds TestDatabaseRepository_List_Empty and TestDatabaseRepository_ListReplicas_Empty\nthat verify the returned slice is non-nil (empty but not nil), ensuring JSON\nmarshaling produces \"[]\" not \"null\".\n\n* refactor(tests): combine empty-list tests into table-driven style\n\n- Refactor TestDatabaseRepository_List_Empty and\n  TestDatabaseRepository_ListReplicas_Empty into a single table-driven\n  test with cases for List and ListReplicas\n- Add mock.ExpectationsWereMet() to verify mock expectations were met\n\n* fix(repos/postgres): add rows.Err() check in scanDatabases\n\nAdd rows.Err() after the rows.Next() loop to catch any iteration\nerrors, matching the pattern used in other repository functions.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-12T15:24:45+03:00",
          "tree_id": "d80307f21096869f4d06b4811909bff811cfb577",
          "url": "https://github.com/poyrazK/thecloud/commit/25ce82d1bfba6641277805d873624a71ba659e85"
