          "message": "Add TLS support for storage node gRPC communication (#551)\n\nAdds optional TLS for all gRPC communication between storage nodes:\n\n- Add StorageTLSEnabled, StorageTLSCertFile, StorageTLSKeyFile to Config\n- Add buildStorageDialOpts() helper in dependencies.go\n- Update NewGossipProtocol to accept dialOpts (nil = insecure default)\n- Add --tls, --tls-cert, --tls-key flags to storage-node binary\n- Pass appropriate dial options based on --tls flag\n\nWhen StorageTLSEnabled=false (default), behavior is unchanged.\nBackward compatible — no changes required to existing deployments.\n\nCo-authored-by: Poyraz <poyraz@example.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-14T16:45:00+03:00",
          "tree_id": "8f7fbad2b54aca7ed33cbcc2979c1ef2a0a0ddab",
          "url": "https://github.com/poyrazK/thecloud/commit/7a2e7d0dab15ea5688e1191c7894f38c2c7725a5"
