          "id": "fd32a7c350fbeff8e04692fa6d5663e11aa9691d",
          "message": "test: add unit tests for FunctionScheduleService (Issue #527) (#550)\n\nAdd 17 new test cases covering:\n- RBAC denial for ListSchedules, GetSchedule, DeleteSchedule, PauseSchedule,\n  ResumeSchedule, GetScheduleRuns\n- Repository errors for ListSchedules, PauseSchedule, GetScheduleRuns\n- Not found scenarios for PauseSchedule and ResumeSchedule\n- Event/Audit log failure handling in CreateSchedule (best-effort)\n- Limit edge cases in GetScheduleRuns (0, negative, >500, <500)\n\nAll tests pass.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-14T16:52:06+03:00",
          "tree_id": "f358c3ea066b69022fc40be83d01b762dd458d08",
